ative rates, please see Dow Jones Markets page [17960]. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES INDIA REPORT  23-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0356GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 62506 \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020011004dt9n01a7n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
