\par\par \b \uc2  Price Stability Key To Floating Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 : India RBI \b0\par\par\uc2 165 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 September 1997\par 14:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--Price stability achieved through adjusting interest rate policies will be the key to ensuring the new floating rate regimes in Southeast Asia succeed, India's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief said Saturday. \par \par \uc2  'With price stability, you can kill many birds with one stone,' Chakravarthy Rangarajan, governor of the Reserve Bank of India said. \par \par \uc2  While the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciations in other Southeast Asian countries will have an impact on India's exports, the country isn't planning on devaluing its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the rupee, he said. \par \par \uc2  'We would like the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate to be determined by market forces, but we will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  quite heavily' to quell volatility, he said. The problem \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  is having, however, isn't so much depreciating \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but an appreciating one, he added, noting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently had to enter the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the rupee. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1257GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9k072tj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
