\par\par \b \uc2  India/Rupee/Weakening -3: RBI Seen Selling Fwd Dlrs \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1997\par 16:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the RBI is expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more in the forward dollar market rather than in the spot market as soon as the latter shows signs of stabilizing. \par \par \uc2  'The RBI will be able to steady the spot-dollar rupee exchange rate largely by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forward dollar market,' said Uday Mulgaonkar, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Kotak Mahindra Capital Co.. \par \par \uc2  Moses of IndusInd Bank said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials are worried more about rising forward premiums, which have moved up to around 8.00% annually for dollars to be delivered in six months. \par \par \uc2  By \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forward dollar market Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  brought these premiums down to around 7.50%. \par \par \uc2  Moses said the forward premiums have a major impact on the trend in the spot dollar rates. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, dealers say importers concerns about a weaker rupee won't be dispelled too easily. \par \par \uc2  'Indian imports are six to seven times its exports and importers are only partly covering their future dollar requirements,' said a chief dealer at a state-owned bank. \par \par \uc2  Even after the recent, relatively small weakening of the rupee, there has been a far greater demand for the dollar from importers and banks. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said even more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the RBI will be needed to calm \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  'Over the past few days the RBI sold about $200 million to meet the increased local demand,' said a dealer at a state-run bank. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1441GMT \par \par \uc2  1139 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9306iq0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
