\par\par \b \uc2  India RBI says seeks to build  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  reserves. \b0\par\par\uc2 171 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, Aug 15 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets are designed to help boost foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, a senior bank official told Reuters Financial Television on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Deputy Governor Y.V. Reddy of the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI), said that RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is designed to ensure that the rupee's exchange rate reflects the ecnomy's fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  "We are in the market to curb excess volatility," he said in reply to a question. "We are also in the business of building adequate reserves." \par \par \uc2  The objectives of RBI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets also encompassed the development of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, Reddy said. \par \par \uc2  But this policy has to be used in conjunction with RBI's money supply strategies, he added. RBI's buying of dollars pumps rupees into the economy and has the effect of increasing India's money supply. \par \par \uc2  --Bombay Newsroom (91) 22 265 9000; Fax (91) 22 264 1699 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt8f013jh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
