\par\par \b \uc2  =India: RBI Seen Continuing Forward Dlr Buying: Analysts \b0\par\par\uc2  By Pankaj Aher \par \uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 1997\par 15:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of India will continue to buy forward dollars in an effort to keep the Indian rupee from appreciating against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said Monday. \par \par \uc2  But the success of the strategy is difficult to predict, they added. \par \par \uc2  Forward-market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably isn't the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's preferred, or most effective, mechanism for trying to affect the spot value of the rupee, but concerns with \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ballooning money supply mean intensive spot market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't an attractive option at present, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'They seem to be confused about what to do,' said a dealer at a private-sector bank. 'Their spot dollar purchases don't seem to be having the desired effect on the exchange rate,' he said. 'And they have the monetary impact of the spot-buying to consider,' he added. \par \par \uc2  Monday, the Reserve Bank is estimated to have purchased around $125 million, most of it in the forward market, in three rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  intended to stop the rupee from appreciating. \par \par \uc2  But despite these forward-market purchases, the rupee gained on the day. The dollar closed around 35.7400 rupees, down from its Friday close between 35.7750 rupees. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  wasn't fruitless, traders said. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably would have sunk below 35.7000 rupees Monday if the RBI hadn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at all. \par \par \uc2  The less-than-successful outcome of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday stood in contrast to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions Friday. A surprise round of forward dollar purchases by the RBI then had sent the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  shooting higher in the spot market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES INDIA REPORT  04-08-97 \par \par \uc2  1325GMT \par \par \uc2  1145 \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020011004dt84011rx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
