\par\par \b \uc2  Indian  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  brakes rupee's rise vs dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Giri Venkatesan \par \uc2 524 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juli 1997\par 16:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, July 11 (Reuter) - The Indian rupee softened on Friday after the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains but it remained around its strongest level for seven months against the U.S. dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the RBI bought dollars after the rupee broke through the 35.70 per dollar barrier, pushing the rupee down to 35.725 in afternoon trade. \par \par \uc2  "The whole purpose of today's trade was to find at what level the RBI will show its hand," said Ravi Kumar, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at ABN-AMRO Bank. \par \par \uc2  "It was a classic market versus RBI situation. And show their hands they did." \par \par \uc2  But the rupee recovered once the RBI went off the market to end at 35.71/72 against its previous close of 35.735/745. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Friday's trade was crucial in determining whether the RBI was prepared to defend the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was largely responsible for the rupee hitting a seven-month high on Thursday, dealers said. Opening at 35.755/765, the rupee hit an intraday high of 35.735 as the RBI kept to the sidelines. \par \par \uc2  The RBI's absence from the market on Thursday triggered speculation on whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would check the rupee's gains or let market forces determine the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the RBI has been constrained by the impact \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has on the domestic money market. The RBI's dollar purchases cause an injection of rupees into the banking system, boosting money supply growth. \par \par \uc2  The latest RBI data shows 16.6 percent year-on-year growth in the M3 measure of money supply for the two weeks ended June 6. It has set a target of 15.0-15.5 percent for 1997/98 (April-March). \par \par \uc2  The Business Standard daily said on Friday that the RBI had decided not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  unless there was an "extreme provocation." \par \par \uc2  The decision was made after a meeting between RBI governor Chakravarty Rangarajan and finance minister P. Chidambaram last Saturday, the newspaper said. \par \par \uc2  An RBI spokeswoman declined to comment on the report. \par \par \uc2  The spokeswoman said RBI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy was guided by the demand-supply situation in the market and it sought to even out any mismatches. \par \par \uc2  The other objective was to keep the value of the rupee close to the real effective exchange rate, the spokeswoman added. \par \par \uc2  Indian exporters have recently complained about the exchange rate, saying the rupee was overvalued and its strength had hurt their competitiveness in international markets. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, neighbouring Pakistan devalued its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and dealers said the move was a technical correction to adjust for the U.S. dollar's appreciation against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The rupee has been buoyant for the past year due to healthy \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows and poor demand for the U.S. dollar. Inflows have been mainly from foreign investment and foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  borrowings by Indian corporates. \par \par \uc2  India's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves leapt to $25.4 billion on June 27 from $19.7 billion on February 28. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7b02oli\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
