\par\par \b \uc2  Exotic  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2 / \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  -4: RBI  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  More Aggressive \b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 1997\par 11:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The RBI has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  more actively this week and is perceived as wanting to hold the rupee down at around 35.85 rupees/dollar. On Monday, the Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was estimated to have bought as much as $150 million, and traders estimate that a similar amount was bought Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Since the beginning of January, RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have increased $2.49 billion to $26.491 billion in the latest week reported ended April 11. \par \par \uc2  James Capel's Govil said the only reason why the RBI hadn't been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars was because it had to maintain an M3 money supply growth target of 15.5% for the fiscal year 1997-98, and aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would release more rupees into the banking system than planned. \par \par \uc2  However, with call rates having shot up to around 10.00% from 1.00% last week, largely because of the strong demand shown for the government's sale last week of state bonds, this was a good time for the RBI to buy dollars to keep the rupee down and and also release rupees into the banking system to ease the call money rate. \par \par \uc2  The rupee has been trading around 35.7 rupees in recent weeks, although aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the last couple of days brought the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down to its present level around 35.865 rupees/dollar. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 08-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0925GMT \par \par \uc2  1106 1838 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5803ao8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
