aid banks had anticipated that the RBI would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, and were hoping to sell the dollars they purchased early in the day to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a profit. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES INDIA REPORT  07-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0544GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020011004dt5700q5u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
