\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  RBI Governor -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervenes \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par 22:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  But he acknowledged that reducing the fiscal deficit 'is not an easy task' in light of the government's recent tax structure reforms and reduction in tariffs as outlined in the Feb. 28 budget for 1997-1998. \par \par \uc2  The budget aims to slash the maximum import tariffs by 10% to 40% in the current fiscal year and cut individual and corporate tax rates. \par \par \uc2  Rangarajan said that in the last few months the RBI has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to slow the Indian rupee's appreciation against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  'In the last few months, purchases (of dollars) made by the Reserve Bank have prevented the appreciation of the rupee,' he said, confirming a widely held believe among local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was quoted at 35.895 rupees on Wednesday, unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The RBI's move, he said, was in line with goverment policies to bring about some degree of balance to the country's balance of payments. \par \par \uc2  He said that a shrinking current account deficit, estimated at lower than 1.7% of GDP for 1996-1997, and fairly large inflows in th capital account has increased India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  'While the capital inflow do play an important part in the transformation process and to some extent reduce the adjustment cost, its impact on the real exchange rate has also to be taken note of,' Rangarajan cautioned. \par \par \uc2  India's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves currently stand at $20.8 billion. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-03-97 \par \par \uc2  2112GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt3j01z57\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
