\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  rupee  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  continues-RBI chief. \b0\par\par\uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, March 12 (Reuter) - The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the rupee from strengthening but a resulting boost to monetary growth was a constraint, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief said in a newspaper interview on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "We have to look at the monetary impact of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and also look at the real effective exchange rate and try to achieve some balance," the RBI governor C. Rangarajan told the Financial Express daily. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in response to a question whether the RBI would help exporters by encouraging a gradual depreciation in the rupee. \par \par \uc2  "I think this is one action we are taking," he said. \par \par \uc2  Rangarajan also said a medium term target for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was to reduce banks' cash reserve ratio (CRR) further below the current 10 percent. \par \par \uc2  "We will have to see what is warranted in the present circumstances," he said. "On the removal of CRR on interbank borrowings, these are all matters under consideration," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief said the dollar has gained substantially in the last 15 months against other major international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , while the rupee/dollar rate has been been very stable for the last nine months. \par \par \uc2  The rupee traded at 35.84 to the dollar on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "Therefore, we certainly look at the real, effective exchange rate," he said. \par \par \uc2  The trade-weighted real effective exchange rate index stood at 63.05 in September 1996, according to lates RBI data, compared to 63.58 in September 1995. \par \par \uc2  "We do not have a target for the level of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves," he said. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at 20.09 on March 6. \par \par \uc2  "Moreover, the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be limited by the impact it (such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has on money supply," Rangarajan said. \par \par \uc2  He said RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not lead to any overshoot of a targetted 16 percent growth in M3 in 1997/98 (April-March). \par \par \uc2  -- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt3c08sx8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
