\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Rupee Ends Flat; Forwards Rise Despite  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Februar 1997\par 12:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee held steady in the spot market but forward rates rose after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  turned out to be smaller than expected. \par \par \uc2  Traders noted that in the spot market the dollar drifted in a narrow range, moving between 35.8775 rupees and 35.8850 rupees amid a lack of substantial demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the forward market, however, traders said banks had gone short on forward dollars in anticipation of selling by the RBI. The bank has sold dollars for August delivery over the past few day, while buying dollars for delivery Friday to meet a debt payment on that day. \par \par \uc2  But traders said that after some early sales the RBI began to withdraw from the market, leading to some short-covering by banks. \par \par \uc2  'They did some deals today but not enough,' a trader who dealt with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  The RBI also bought small amounts of spot dollars in afternoon trading around 35.88 rupees, traders added. But those sales seemed designed simply to mop up excess supply rather than alter rates, they said. \par \par \uc2  A spokeswoman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on the bank's activities. \par \par \uc2  At the 1030 GMT (5:30 a.m. EST) close of Bombay interbank trading, the dollar was quoted at 35.8800 rupees, down marginally from 35.8850 rupees Tuesday. The premium for dollars for August delivery was quoted at 1.39 rupees, up from 1.30 rupees. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1135GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 62506 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2c013yq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
