\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Rupee Drops Vs Dlr Despite Reserve Bank's  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 1996\par 13:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (AP-Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee lost again in a second straight day of volatile trading Tuesday despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) that partially checked the fall. \par \par \uc2  The dollar opened around 35.75 rupees, but quickly climbed to a high of 35.91 rupees on heavy demand throughout the market, traders said. They added that the State Bank of India was a big dollar buyer early on, but even after it withdrew demand for dollars from other players continued to drive the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher. \par \par \uc2  But the RBI began to sell dollars around midday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose above 35.90 rupees. The RBI sold until the dollar came down to the level of 35.83 rupees, traders said. A spokeswoman for the RBI confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars to the market, but as usual declined to specify the amounts or rates at which it acted. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the size of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was relatively modest, but added that it was enough to prompt traders to reverse their positions. \par \par \uc2  'Rather than the actual sales by RBI, it was the news of the bank entering the market which checked the rise of the dollar,' a trader with a European bank said. \par \par \uc2  At the 1030 GMT close of Bombay's interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the dollar was quoted at 35.79 rupees, up from Monday's close of 35.70 rupees. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-07-96 \par \par \uc2  1146GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds7g05rth\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
