\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS--Indian rupee gains vs dlr after 6-mth fall. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Shyam Kumar \par \uc2 560 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, Feb 27 (Reuter) - The Indian rupee has recovered from a six month-long battering on the back of rising foreign investments and steps by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to strengthen the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers and analysts said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "What is interesting (about the rupee's recovery) is that it did not require massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI)," said T.T. Ram Mohan, head of research at Birla Marlin Securities. \par \par \uc2  The rupee began to fall by August 1995 after holding steady against the dollar for almost two years at 31.37 to a dollar. \par \par \uc2  "The drop was too fast, and now the recovery has been fast," said the chief \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a newly-established Indian bank. \par \par \uc2  He said Indian importers were desperately buying dollars in the first week of February, when the rupee touched an all-time low of 38.50 to a dollar. \par \par \uc2  The scenario had reversed by this week, with importers no longer in a hurry to cover their imports and exporters beginning to worry about the appreciating rupee. \par \par \uc2  The rupee recovered to 36.50 level by mid-February and was widely expected to stabilise at this level. But on Monday, the rupee breached the 36 per dollar barrier to trade at 35.87/92. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was traded at 35.65/68 rupees on Tuesday. Several bankers said they expected the dollar to trade in the 35.50-36.50 range until the fiscal year ending on March 31. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the trend reversal was triggered by the combined impact of a spurt in foreign portfolio and direct investment and a package of measures by the RBI to brake the free fall in the rupee. \par \par \uc2  "FII (foreign institutional investors) investments and positive comments from the government made an impact," said Moses Harding, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Indusind Bank in Bombay. \par \par \uc2  The chief dealer at a European bank in Bombay said RBI's abolition of concessional dollar-denominated credit to Indian exporters made their funding costlier and dealt a blow to the practice of giving longer credit to their overseas clients. \par \par \uc2  The RBI on February 7 also freed interest on rupee credit to Indian exporters above 90 days with a view to forcing them to repatriate their earnings earlier. \par \par \uc2  "The RBI was for long accused of not telling the market the (exchange) range it wanted," said a dealer. The RBI measures and subsequent statements by its top officials signalled that it would not tolerate a weak rupee, he said. \par \par \uc2  But what really tilted sentiment was the spurt in FII investment on Indian bourses estimated as high as $500 million in February, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  According to official figures for January, FII investment up to January 25 totalled $233.4 million. It was $121 million in December, 1995. \par \par \uc2  "It's the opposite of what happened in Mexico," said a dealer at a private Indian bank. "When their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell, FIIs withdrew. Here they have been investing." \par \par \uc2  "But one should bear in mind that capital flows, either way, can have a disproportionate effect on the exchange rate," said Ram Mohan of Birla Marlin Securities. \par \par \uc2  The RBI on Monday said India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose to $20.63 billion as on February 16 from $20.56 billion a week ago. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019ds2r00yef\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
